# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Development happens on Windows; CI and the scheduled jobs run on Linux. Without
# this, every file checked out on Windows comes back with CRLF and shows as
# wholly modified, which buries real diffs in noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and generated files git should not try to diff or normalise.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
drizzle/meta/** -diff linguist-generated
